    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "rulebook_inhalt",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 448,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "structure  ·  vault rules  ·  search order  ·  session routines\ngit sync  ·  skill reflex  ·  model strategy  ·  maintenance\n\nThe adapters contain no rules of their own. They are three lines\nthat say: read AGENTS.md.",
      "originalText": "structure  ·  vault rules  ·  search order  ·  session routines\ngit sync  ·  skill reflex  ·  model strategy  ·  maintenance\n\nThe adapters contain no rules of their own. They are three lines\nthat say: read AGENTS.md.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
