    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "vault_baum",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 732,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 360,
      "text": "00 Context        who you are, who you serve, how you write\n01 Inbox          capture first, sort later\n02 Projects       active work with an end date\n03 Areas          standing responsibilities, no end date\n04 Resources      the knowledge base\n05 Daily Notes    one file per day, the continuity between sessions\n06 Archive        finished work, moved only on request\n07 Attachments    images, PDFs, media\n99 Templates      so new notes start with the right frontmatter\n\ntodos.md          cross-project priorities, five lines per entry\n.maintenance-log  when the two upkeep routines last ran",
      "originalText": "00 Context        who you are, who you serve, how you write\n01 Inbox          capture first, sort later\n02 Projects       active work with an end date\n03 Areas          standing responsibilities, no end date\n04 Resources      the knowledge base\n05 Daily Notes    one file per day, the continuity between sessions\n06 Archive        finished work, moved only on request\n07 Attachments    images, PDFs, media\n99 Templates      so new notes start with the right frontmatter\n\ntodos.md          cross-project priorities, five lines per entry\n.maintenance-log  when the two upkeep routines last ran",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
