      "id": "vault_git",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "Plain Markdown in a git repo. Nothing proprietary, no database,\nno lock-in. Every change is a commit, every mistake is revertible,\nand any editor or agent can read it.",
