    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "wartung_erklaerung",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 1470,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 90,
      "text": "The first keeps the tooling current. The second asks whether the\nvault still agrees with itself — a decision reversed, an old version\nleft behind, two notes now disagreeing. No structural check finds\nthat, because both files are perfectly well-formed.\nNeither report may claim it covered the other's ground.",
      "originalText": "The first keeps the tooling current. The second asks whether the\nvault still agrees with itself — a decision reversed, an old version\nleft behind, two notes now disagreeing. No structural check finds\nthat, because both files are perfectly well-formed.\nNeither report may claim it covered the other's ground.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 920035,
      "version": 1,
